  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_01",
      "hash64": "EB85F4E3122FF757",
      "text": "嗨～阿羅拉！\\n我超喜歡阿羅拉的寶可夢的呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_02",
      "hash64": "EB85F5E3122FF90A",
      "text": "我好想看一眼\\n阿羅拉的樣子的隆隆岩，\\r\\n牠是否在[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的同行寶可夢或盒子裡呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_03",
      "hash64": "EB85F6E3122FFABD",
      "text": "就只有隆隆岩，\\n我怎麼找就是找不到……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_04",
      "hash64": "EB85EFE3122FEED8",
      "text": "那隻寶可夢……\\n連隆隆岩都不是呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_05",
      "hash64": "EB85F0E3122FF08B",
      "text": "那隻寶可夢……\\n是普通的隆隆岩喔！！\\r\\n我想看的是！阿羅拉的樣子！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_06",
      "hash64": "EB85F1E3122FF23E",
      "text": "那隻寶可夢……\\n是阿羅拉的樣子的隆隆岩！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_07",
      "hash64": "EB85F2E3122FF3F1",
      "text": "頭上爆～得超有異國情調！\\n眉毛跟鬍子也是威風凜凜呢～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_08",
      "hash64": "EB85EBE3122FE80C",
      "text": "……牠是透過連線交換來進化，\\n所以才很難找到野生的吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_09",
      "hash64": "EB85ECE3122FE9BF",
      "text": "在感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的同時，請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳擺擺看\\n這個既阿羅拉又隆隆岩的表情吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_system_01",
      "hash64": "340BF1E47E73D21E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]從女孩那裡\\n學會了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]電Ｚ表情[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
